prompts.user_prompt_template:
请根据以下输入完成自动评分：

[岗位信息]
job_name: {{job_name}}
job_jd: {{job_jd}}
screening_requirements: {{screening_requirements}}

[评分表]
score_table_version: {{score_table_version}}
score_table_json:
{{score_table_json}}

[候选人信息]
candidate_id: {{candidate_id}}
candidate_profile_json:
{{candidate_profile_json}}

[候选人原文补充（仅用于缺失字段）]
resume_text: {{resume_text}}

[评分参数]
strong_threshold: {{strong_threshold}}
recommend_threshold: {{recommend_threshold}}
review_threshold: {{review_threshold}}
conservative_when_missing: true

请严格按 System 要求输出 JSON。
